{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜李家超出席APEC領導人非正式會議／赤洲與內地恐龍化石展開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261119.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超今日(11月19日)出席APEC領導人非正式會議，並與其他經濟體領導人會面。另外，見龍在田赤洲與內地恐龍化石展在九龍公園文物探知館舉行開幕禮。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.314295+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:30:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T01:57:35.870069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:57:52.294333+00:00","content_hash":"aa6864638ce7d8ea887ee2e78d09c41d4bf19fed625d9b1394f07f3d45cae5b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}